      "risk_review": {
        "status": "open",
        "reviewer": "alpha-batch-52",
        "notes": "Read all three steps and all direct prerequisite interfaces, including complete quotient and second-quantized multiplier proofs. Rank two, closed positive range, null radical, nonnegative hbar*c scaling and exact maximal domain (including vacuum) check out. Statement and L2/2.1 still import strong continuity with no declared group topology in batch-44 supplier. Refuter:52:2 remains escalated; no sound local consumer-only closure preserves that supplier claim."
